 "description": "<p>Christmas red applied to the maid formula: dress, apron, and headband in polyester, one size for 40-60 kg. The apron stays white against the red dress, which is the color contrast that makes the set read instantly.</p>\n<p>Three pieces is the right count - dress for the silhouette, apron for the theme, headband for the finish. No thong or extras in the bag, keeping the costume comfortable for full-evening wear.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: dress, apron, headband</li>\n<li>Style: Christmas maid</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fits 40-60 kg. The December version of a category standard, and the apron is cut generously enough to layer over the dress properly.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Red Christmas maid set with dress, apron and headband, one size for 40-60 kg, polyester costume.</p>\n",
